# MASTER PROMPT — ADARUPA
## Jelajah Budaya Nusantara
### Complete Web Application, UI/UX, Google Apps Script Backend, Google Drive Media Management

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, product designer, UI/UX architect, Google Apps Script specialist, and digital cultural platform developer.

Your task is to design and build a functional, production-oriented, mobile-first web application named **ADARUPA — Jelajah Budaya Nusantara**.

ADARUPA is a digital cultural platform for discovering Indonesian folklore films, audio storytelling, traditional games, and cultural events. It must be visually distinctive, easy to use, responsive across devices, accessible to a broad audience, and manageable by administrators without manually editing source code every time new content is published.

Do not build only a landing page or static prototype. Build the application as a structured, extensible product with functional navigation, reusable components, working user interactions, clear backend integration contracts, and an administrator content management system.

